@startuml State Diagram
[*] --> Pending : submit valid expense / persist shares
state Pending
state Approved
state Rejected
Pending --> Approved : approve [active manager && reviewer != submitter]
Pending --> Rejected : reject [active manager && reviewer != submitter]
Approved --> [*] : balance eligible
Rejected --> [*] : retained; no balance effect
note right of Pending
Pending has no balance effect.
Only a pending expense can be reviewed.
end note
note right of Approved
Approved shares are counted once
by BalanceService.
end note
note right of Rejected
Rejected record remains historical
and never changes balances.
end note
@enduml
